  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-31T23:19:15.393Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be great to create a world category for tutorial worlds. As iterations of the game and SDK progresses. Worlds in this category can also be updated so we don’t have to worry about outdated Youtube or web-source tutorials. I also think it could produce more interest in creating tutorials which would naturally lead to people creating more content. \n~Awoo.",
